window.products.push({"id":896010,"name":"Styx Photo with Reproduction Signature archival Quality","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o4bsdDy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Printed on 8.50 x 11 semi-gloss archival photo paper. 2. Largest DPI available, printed professionally, crisp and clear. Please note that vintage photos, advertisements and posters show their age and our reprints reflect that. 3. Prints are not sized to a true 8 x 10 due to the original size but can easily be matted to an 11 x 14 for easy framing. 4. The clown image is simply a stock photo to show packing material. We first use a rigid mylar sleeve to protect the photo then a rigid Photo mailer. 5. The signatures you see are \"Reproductions\" printed on the photo. NOT hand signed by the artist. Extremely real looking. 6. Shipped immediately by USPS 1st. Class mail only which will take up to 5 days for delivery. 7. We have thousands of vintage photos, please check out our selection...... Thanks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o4bsdDy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B084WWJCWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084WWJCWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084WWJCWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":896011,"name":"Vegetable and Fruit Chopper,4 IN 1,vegetable slicer and cube with Grape & Tomatoe Slicer, 1/2 & 1/4 Cut, Adjustable Slicer & Dicer With Storage Contai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R9a5nOlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHOP, SLICE, DICE AND STORE. REPEAT! ONLY WITH THE TIABO MAGIC CHOPPER PLUS! Sometimes all you need to make an amazing meal are amazing tools. With the proper instruments at your disposal, you can get things done quickly and effectively, so that dinner is on the table in no time at all. The Tiabo Magic Chopper Plus is specifically designed to help you chop, slice, and dice vegetables and fruits to your heart's content, without having to waste time or energy! Finally you can chop, slice, dice and serve your guests just like a real professional chef!Our product is very easy to use! Put that knife away and use our magic chopper for all your cooking needs! To chop up vegetables all you need to do is place them on the stainless steel blades, and push down. They come out uniformly sliced or diced all the time! Not only does this revolutionary gadget save you time, space, money, and energy, but it also makes cutting onions a breeze, and thus saves you tears as well!Another benefit to using our machine is an easier clean up! You will not have a huge mess to clean up since all of your diced and chopped up vegetables or fruits are collected in the bowl. And any stray pieces that you may need to pick out of the machine is made easier to do so with our specialized clean up comb! Not having to gather vegetable and fruits pieces when you use the Tiabo Magic Chopper Plus means that you literally cut your preparation time in half! Easy in, easy out---that is the Tiabo way! Features: Has 4 blades for chopping, slicing and dicing  Comes with Collector Bowl  Has Container Cover Dishwasher Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R9a5nOlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiabo","source_asin":"B01MD1AOTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MD1AOTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MD1AOTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
