window.products.push({"id":896088,"name":"Enoz Lavender Scented Moth Ball Packets, Kills Clothes Moths, Carpet Beetles, Eggs and Larvae, 12 oz Resealable Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-OWnmIlKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENOZ MOTH BALL PACKETS: These lavender scented flat moth ball packets are great for flat storage, like drawers, closet shelves, or blanket chests and trunks. Keep your delicate woolens safe from moths without the musty scent of moth balls or the mess of moth crystals KILLS CLOTHES MOTHS AND CARPET BEETLES AND THEIR EGGS & LARVAE: Enoz moth preventatives are a sure method of moth repellent. Enoz moth balls, moth bars, moth cakes, and moth crystals kill clothing moths, moth eggs, moth larvae, carpet beetles, carpet beetle eggs, and carpet beetle larvae when used in air-tight containers. Moth Ball Packets are designed for long-term or seasonal storage, like closets, drawers, blanket chests, sweater boxes, and trunks for worry-free moth protection. LAVENDER SCENTED: This is not your Grandmother's moth ball! These lavender-scented moth ball packets penetrate every fold and crease of stored items ensuring worry-free moth protection without that musty moth ball smell. SAY GOODBYE TO INDOOR BUG PROBLEMS: Flies, bees, cockroaches, moths, and mosquitos all have one thing in common - they aren't welcome in your home. From flyswatters to moth balls, cedar spray to cockroach powder, we have your pest repellent needs covered. Keep your home pest free with Enoz bug repellent products. Fighting an infestation isn't easy, so let Enoz help if you've been pleased with Terro traps, Neem oil, Ecosmart Organic Insect Killer & Greenerways. There is no exact expiration date for mothballs. Sealed packages of mothballs containing paradichlorobenzene will have a very long shelf life of several years. In a hot area like an attic where convection currents may be moving more air about, those mothball life expectancies will be less due to the effects of both temperature and air movement or air velocity on the sublimation rate of the mothballs. The date printed on the package is our manufacturing date. e.g. MFG 01/26/22.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-OWnmIlKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enoz","source_asin":"B074QTW36J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074QTW36J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074QTW36J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
