window.products.push({"id":896208,"name":"Eglaf 2L Stainless Steel Grease Strainer - Large Capacity Oil Container with Removable Filter - Dustproof Lid & Anti-Scalding Handheld - Storage Can f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZXC5ivQL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel When the heavy metals migrated during the use of stainless steel products exceed the limit, it may endanger human health. So the production of stainless steel cookware needs to find a balance between corrosion prevention and safety. As we all know, stainless steel products related to \"edible\" must use 304, 316 stainless steel. Food grade stainless steel used in daily necessities is mostly 304 stainless steel, which has good acid and alkali resistance and strong corrosion resistance. 304 stainless steel is a very common stainless steel. Generally, 304 stainless steel is not food grade, but our stainless steel grease Strainer specially processed food grade. All parts are made of food-grade 304 stainless steel. The polished brushed stainless steel surface is smooth and textured. Not rusty and easy to clean. 1mm Ultra-Fine Filter The mesh of the food-grade stainless steel filter is small to only 1mm, can filter out all kinds of small residues to get the clearest oil or other liquid. Minimize the degree of reused frying harmful substances. Removable Of All Parts The food-grade stainless steel dust cover, filter screen, and base are all independent and portable parts. There are extra dust-proof edges on the cover, which effectively prevent grease from being contaminated. Anti-Scald System Even freshly heated oil can be taken away and stored immediately, and the insulated stainless steel handles meet this need. There is also a hand-held edge on the filter net, can be picked up at any time for disposal. ★★★Customer Service We are committed to providing our customers with the best service and products. If you have any problems during use, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yZXC5ivQL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eglaf","source_asin":"B08BFX66HY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BFX66HY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BFX66HY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
