window.products.push({"id":896252,"name":"Becko Office Chair Ergonomic Home Office Desk Chair with Mesh Computer Chair with Comfy Seat Cushion Breathable Backrest Adjustable Lumbar Support Arm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZpN1bqAqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design - Becko office chair is characterized by comfort and durability. Unique S-shaped backrest, together with an adjustable lumbar pillow, allows you to customize your exclusive chair that perfectly fits the curves of your body and effectively alleviates pressure on your waist and back. Also comes with a curved retractable headrest, armrests that can be raised and lowered, breathable mesh backrest and soft cushion to reduce fatigue and add comfort during the busy workday. Synchronized Reclining Design - Designed with synchronized reclining function and can be set up at 5 angles from 90° to 125°. You can freely switch to work mode or rest mode by reclining the backrest at a certain angle that best suits you, and the cushion and armrests would tilt in sync to ensure overall comfort. Breathable Mesh Backrest - The backrest is processed out of premium mesh material that is breathable and comfortable, and is sturdy and durable enough to ensure you a cool and sweat-free experience during the steaming hot summer. The cushion is formed with 3-inch high density original shaped sponge, covered with breathable mesh fabric for sturdiness and durability. Soft material just helps to alleviate pressure on hip nerves and blood vessels, and promote blood circulation in your legs. Stable Structure - Such office chair is equipped with a firm chassis that enhances the overall stability, while the reinforced metal base and PU casters ensure further security and smooth moves on the ground. It comes with a maximum bearing capacity of up to 330 lbs. For Home & Office Use - If you need to work for long hours at home or in office, then such ergonomic office chair can be an ideal choice for you. Premium material guarantees sturdiness and durability. It is reasonably designed to achieve excellent ventilation and comfort, avoid heat accumulation, alleviate fatigue and reduce harm to your spine after long hours of working in the chair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZpN1bqAqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Becko US","source_asin":"B08YJ693J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YJ693J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YJ693J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
