window.products.push({"id":896309,"name":"4th of July Decorations, DEWBIN America Patriotic 3-Layered Large Size Wood Sign, Uncle Sam Hat Ornaments Fourth of July Decor, God Bless America, Far","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CUUKoB3KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🗽【AMERICAN PATRIOTIC DECORATION】 This 4th of July decoration consists of 2 PCS 3-layered wood signs. The top layer of the Uncle Sam Hat block is separated from the bottom piece of 2 layers of wood. At first glance, you can see the inspiring Uncle Sam Hat with white-red stripes and white stars against a blue background. And the words \"God Bless America\" printed in the 2nd and 3rd wood block can be a good blessing to your family and our great America. 🚀【SAFE ＆ ENVIRONMENTAL-FRIENDLY MATERIALS】 This fourth of July decoration is made of solid wood which is odorless, thick, unbreakable and safe to use. And special process creates a smooth surface without burrs. And it makes use of reclaimed wood which can protect our environment. The superior printing technique keeps it from fading so that the clearly visible lettering on the rectangular blocks is difficult to be erase. The wooden sign is durable because of its excellent craftsmanship. 🎈【FREE-STANDING TO WIDE APPLICATION】 Uncle Sam never falls. The size of the wood hat is 4.3’’ L x 4.1’’ H and the size of the bottom 2 layers is 7’’ L x 2’’ W x 4.1’ ’H. This right thickness allows it to stand firmly and easily on the table, effectively reducing the drop caused by a collision in daily use. It is an ideal 4th of July decoration for your home, living room, dining table, trays, coffee table, bookshelf, fireplace, and office. 💙【4TH OF JULY FUNNY GIFTS】 Patriotic decorations of red, white, and blue, children shouting in parades, spinning noise-makers, wine, and giant flags: sounds like the perfect birthday celebration! People not only celebrate the nation's birthday, but they celebrate their friends, family, and the ones they love. This Uncle Sam Hat patriotic decoration must be a surprising gift that can ignite your partner's enthusiasm and make him/her overjoyed at the 4th of July celebration. 🎉【WE ARE STAY WITH YOU AFTER SALE】 If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We provide 90 days warranty and 24/7 online support customer service. If there is a major problem with our products, we will issue you a full refund or a replacement. God Bless America！Happy 4th of July！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CUUKoB3KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEWBIN","source_asin":"B0B9ZSJD3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9ZSJD3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9ZSJD3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
