window.products.push({"id":896332,"name":"satisomnia Lightweight Comforter Blue Queen Summer Comforter Queen Bed Comforter All Season Down Alternative Reversible Comforter Queen Duvet Insert F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dfqxxpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REVERSIBLE & LIGHTWEIGHT. The navy comforter queen is reversible comforter design, one side is navy and another side is light blue, it will add a splash of color to your bedroom. The blue comforter full is filled with WHOLE-PIECE MICROFIBER, it is a light comforter queen but warm and it can be used all the year round. The fabric of the lightweight comforter navy queen is soft breathable, it provides a comfy and cozy feel throughout the night. GIFT CHOICE. The navy queen comforter can be used in guest room, master bedroom, child's room, rv room, this full navy blue comforter is also definately an ideal gift choice for your family and friends on Mother's Day, Father's Day, Birthday, Christmas, New year, Back to school(blue comforter full for college) and Housewarming. These are more colors available, navy blue comforter, black grey comforter, red black comforter, dark gray and light grey comforter, white comforter BREATHABLE & SOFT. The blanket comforter full navy is designed with breathability in mind, it provides plush comfort for both summer and winter nights. The blue comforter queen is made in OEKO-TEX 100 factory, the fabric is this full xl size comforter friendly for your skin and provides you a noiseless comfortable sleep. The twin / twin xl comforter size is 68 x 90 inches, the full / queen comforter size is 90 x 90 inches, the king / california king comforter size is 106 x 90 inches. MACHINE WASHABLE. This navy bed comforter queen is easy to keep clean, the full queen summer comforter blue can be machine wash in the gentle cycle with cold water, tumble dry on low. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE. If your sleeping experience with the navy full queen duvet insert isn’t absolutely exceptional, contact us pls. We would address the problem ASAP with the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dfqxxpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"satisomnia","source_asin":"B08NWTMR35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NWTMR35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NWTMR35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
