window.products.push({"id":896415,"name":"Black & Decker 12 Cup Stainless Coffee Maker with Vortex Technology","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EiowJ4xjL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Brew coffee just the way you like it. This 12-cup* coffeemaker features VORTEX™ Technology, which evenly saturates coffee grounds for full and rich flavor extraction using optimal water temperatures. You can change the brew strength with the option for a slower brewing process and stronger cup of coffee. Set how long you want to keep coffee warm after brewing with the adjustable keep warm timer (options for 30, 60, 90, 120 min, and OFF). Sneak-A-Cup™ Technology lets you pour a cup of coffee before the rest of the pot has brewed--all without any drips or spills. Other useful features include: Smart-Clean automatic cleaning cycle, 12-cup* Duralife™ glass carafe, washable brew basket, and “Keep Hot” heated carafe plate to make sure coffee is hot when you’re ready to drink it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EiowJ4xjL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black","source_asin":"B09C2VHRC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C2VHRC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C2VHRC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":896416,"name":"Umbra Buddy Space-Saving Over The Cabinet Storage Hooks, Kitchen and Bathroom Organizer, Set of 2, White, 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pA2jV-aXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Another fun addition to the Buddy Collection, the Buddy OTD CAB Hook 2 Pack are 2 single over the door hooks featuring Umbra’s classic Buddy figurine. Utilizing unused storage space, these over the door cabinet hooks are the perfect playful space-saving solution for creating easy access to towels or other items. Buddy OTD CAB Hook features an extra built-in hook on the inside of your cabinet door and cushioning EVA foam pad to improve fit while protecting the cabinet door surface. These useful hooks help to organize your counter space while ensuring articles stay in place with its rubber non-slip tip and bar. Fits most standard kitchen or bathroom cabinet doors. Measures 2 ½ x 3 x 5“ (6. 2 x 7. 4 x 12. 9 cm).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pA2jV-aXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B0BDM36X8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDM36X8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDM36X8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
