window.products.push({"id":896431,"name":"Windy Hill Collection 18\" Inch Standing Animated Musical Dancing Accordion Ethnic Black African American Santa Claus Christmas Figurine Figure Decorat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QWbryElfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"He moves! His head sways to Christmas tunes as he opens & closes his accordion to an entire litany of 8 short classic Christmas tunes “Jingle Bells”, “We Wish You A Merry Christmas”, “Silent Night”, “Deck the Halls”, “Joy to the World”, “The First Noel”, “Hark the Herald Angels Sing”, and “O’ Christmas Tree” (O’ Tannenbaum). His deep burgundy coat, gold trim, and gold bells on his hat spread Christmas cheer and music wherever he goes. He is carrying a dark green toy bag laced with gold trim and loaded with wrapped presents and a miniature book. He stands firmly on any flat surface as he dances and plays his accordion into the Christmas night. His wonderfully soft beard and mustache add warmth and charm and match his rimless glasses and jovial expression, and his hat has a hidden wire to adjust to any configuration. There is no more jovial cheerful Santa than this delightful accordion dancing Santa. He plays; “Jingle Bells”, “We Wish You A Merry Christmas”, “Silent Night”, “Deck the Halls”, “Joy to the World”, “The First Noel”, “Hark the Herald Angels Sing”, and “O’ Christmas Tree” (O’ Tannenbaum). There is an on/off switch, and requires 3 AA batteries not included. His outstanding accordion songs are guaranteed to bring a smile to your holiday season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QWbryElfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy Hill Collection","source_asin":"B09VMQDMGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VMQDMGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VMQDMGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
