window.products.push({"id":896449,"name":"nambe Dune 5-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set | 18/10 Mirror Stainless Steel Silverware Cutlery Set | Designed for Home Kitchens, Hotel, or Restaura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yhOJQTxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This Nambé classic could have been crafted by the wind. Soft crescent-like arcs and rhythmic crests animate this ageless design. Forged in dishwasher safe 18/10 stainless steel. Dune reflects the landscape of it¿s origin, the timeless majesty of New Mexico. Amazon.com Dune is such a well-crafted pattern that setting the table with it is like creating a work of art. Lou Henry designed the pattern with long, slim handles that arc subtly off the table and rest on flattened surfaces underneath the pointed end. Exhibiting contemporary edginess, the straight-backed knife vertically balances on its blade. No ornamentation is needed to embellish the handles, just smooth, oval spoon bowls and long, elegant fork tines that lend a perfect weight and balance. Dune is forged of dishwasher-safe 18/10 stainless steel, and gleams with a mirror finish. Any dinnerware, for casual or fine dining, is enhanced by this simple yet striking Nambé pattern. The five-piece place setting for one consists of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company has focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Stainless steel, porcelain, and crystal pieces now join Nambé's signature metal-alloy lines, all of which are flawlessly crafted and exceptional as gifts. Nambé has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many prestigious institutions. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yhOJQTxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B000VXSW56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXSW56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXSW56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
