window.products.push({"id":896536,"name":"Scott Living Flynn Jacquard Cotton Sateen 3-Piece Duvet Cover and Sham Set | Full/Queen | Harbor Mist Gray Geometric | Designer Home Bedding | All Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l7p9euJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a reversible 55%Cotton, 45%Polyester textural jacquard duvet. The geometric design face with woven sheen plays up the tonalities of gray for an impactful elevated look. While the reverse is a calming solid gray in a breathable, cool-crisp durable cotton percale weave that gets softer over time. Queen Set Includes: 1 Queen Duvet Cover (90in x 92in), 2 Standard Shams (20in x 26in) King Set Includes: 1 King Duvet Cover (104in x 92in), 2 King Shams (20in x 36in). MUST HAVE FEATURES Our contemporary duvet cover and pillow shams are constructed with a knife edge finish for a tailored look. A soft cotton twill tie is perfectly stitched at each corner for a secure fit of your duvet insert with a hidden button closure for easy opening and closing. Each sham includes a center opening with a five-inch overlap to secure the pillow. These clean corners, out of sight closures, comfortable and quality materials make this a perfect luxury designer duvet set. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living bedding is better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton blend duvet set is environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable unlike microfiber that is difficult to break down. EASY CARE, Machine wash cold, normal cycle with like colors. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Warm iron if needed. Do not dry clean. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the Sonora Quilt Set and the Cody HygroCotton Sateen 400 Thread-Count Performance Sheet Set, all by Scott Living. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91l7p9euJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09LYVCMV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYVCMV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYVCMV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":896537,"name":"overstockArt Vincent Van Gogh Starry Night 8-Inch by 10-Inch Framed Oil on Canvas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5qx1gFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Hand painted oil reproduction of Starry Night , one of the most famous paintings by Vincent Van Gogh. This gorgeous 1889 masterpiece has been carefully recreated, detail-by-detail, to near perfection. One of today's most recognized paintings, Starry Night invokes deep emotions, from the serenity of the church steeple to the wild abandon use of vibrant colors in his late night sky. Imagine the movement of the painter as he twists and turns his brush to create the dance between the stars and the clouds above the calm, peaceful village. Known as a prolific Post-Impressionist, Van Gogh produced many paintings that were heavily biographical. Vincent Van Gogh's restless spirit and depressive mental state inspired his artistic work. This work of art awakens the same emotions and beauty as the original piece. Why settle for a print when you can add sophistication to your room with a beautiful, fine gallery reproduction oil painting? Why not grace your home with this reproduced masterpiece? It is sure to bring many admirers! Frame Description: New Age Black Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5qx1gFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"overstockArt","source_asin":"B002ZNDTNU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002ZNDTNU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002ZNDTNU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
