window.products.push({"id":896572,"name":"PIPE DECOR Industrial Shelf Brackets with Square Flanges, Set of Four, Malleable Iron Fittings for Custom DIY Floating Shelves, Vintage Furniture Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HV2Ipt8LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW SQUARE FLANGE DESIGN. We have updated our popular four inch double flange brackets with a new patent pending square flange. Our new design covers more area and has a distinct boxy look. These brackets pair wonderfully with wood shelves and are great for displaying what is important to you. Neatly showcase your books, photos, plants, or candles to create a personalized atmosphere in any room. SUITABLE WITH A WIDE VARIETY OF STYLES. Quality never goes out of style. Industrial pipe fits with a variety of styles including: vintage, modern, farmhouse, french country house, rustic, industrial, steampunk, cabin, and more. Enhance the appearance of any kitchen, bar, living room, or bedroom with some quality open shelving. A few shelves are a great option for neat book storage. Display your favorite novels in style. AUTHENTIC INDUSTRIAL PIPE. These are authentic iron pipes and fittings built to stand the test of time. Please be aware that these components come coated in a light industrial grease in order to slow the rusting process that gradually occurs over time. CLEANING AND SEALING IS REQUIRED FOR THOSE WHO DESIRE A MORE FINISHED LOOK. Most installations are left unfinished, but we understand that everyone's tastes are different, and have included cleaning instructions for those who favor a neater style. INCLUDED. Each order comes with 4 shelving brackets that are comprised of (4) 1/2 inch 90° elbows, (8) 1/2 inch square floor flanges, (4) 1/2 inch X 4 inch pipe connectors, (4) 1/2 inch X 1-1/4 inch pipe connectors, a set of instructions, as well as all necessary screws and hardware to mount to your wall. Wood shelves/boards are NOT included. WE ARE HERE TO HELP: Please reach out to us should you have any questions, concerns, or complaints. We take pride in the quality products that we offer and the care that we provide our customers. Please take a look at the wide array of other PIPE DÉCOR pieces and kits that we have for sale to give your space a more complete look as well. Have a wonderful day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HV2Ipt8LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIPE DECOR","source_asin":"B07XC8YY5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XC8YY5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XC8YY5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
