window.products.push({"id":896716,"name":"MyFancyCraft Handmade USA Beer Cap - Map - Solid 0.25\" Thick - 69 Piece - Wood Bottle Cap - Holder with Wall - Hanger - Quality & Guarantee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YVPJ4Y7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beer cap map is made of high-quality 1/4 inch thick plywood sheet, which is designed for long years of use and collecting beer caps .   We have developed a special hanger that allows you to fix the map to the wall, creating the effect of the map hanging in the air.The map is easy to put on the hanger so that you can simply update your collection. We hope that with the help of this map you will gather your colorful collection not only of beer caps but also of vivid impressions and memories !  The perfect way for any beer enthusiasts to display their favorite craft beers. The holes are the standard size to hold all of your favorite caps. Finishing nails and holder are included so you can hang your the United States beer cap map right away. This craft beer cap map is perfect for a men gift. Get him something unique for his man cave and any special day. Beer Life Story Looking up and seeing your collection of bottle caps will bring back memories of trips you took, people you got to spend time with or a great meal you had. You can instantly put yourself back in those moments when looking at your beautiful bottle cap collection.   Here are some of the reasons why this Beer Cap Map is the perfect gift for any beer lover:  1) A unique gift: collect the history of beer and enjoy it for a long time!  2) Сonvenience hanger: You can choose how to hang it, using special wall mount or pre-drilled holes.  3) For any special day: Birthday, Father's Day, Saint Patrick's Day, Beer Day, Christmas, New Year, Party etc.  4) Decoration for home or office: a beautiful color of wood and eye-catching attribute in any design.  5) Detailed: USA Map with separation into the States.  ... 100% satisfaction guarantee! Size: 14.4х24\"  Please note, that the beer caps have to be inserted from the backside of the map.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YVPJ4Y7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyFancyCraft","source_asin":"B06XT5B6WD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XT5B6WD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XT5B6WD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":896717,"name":"Carlisle FoodService Products 4354005 Melamine Bouillon Cups, 8 oz, Red (Pack of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WJZgBbRaL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Dallas Ware Melamine Bouillon Cup - the perfect solution for your food service needs. With a generous capacity of 8 ounces, this bouillon cup is perfect for serving soups, stews, and other hot or cold dishes. Its durable melamine construction makes it resistant to chipping, cracking, and breaking, ensuring long-lasting use in busy food service environments. The temperature insulation of this bouillon cup is perfect for maintaining the temperature of hot or cold dishes, keeping them at their optimal serving temperature for longer periods of time. Its classic styling adds a touch of elegance to any table setting, while its stackable design allows for convenient storage and space-saving. This bouillon cup is also dishwasher safe, ensuring easy and efficient cleaning after use. Additionally, it is NSF listed, ensuring that it meets strict public health and safety standards. Whether you're a restaurant, catering service, or any food service establishment, the Dallas Ware Melamine Bouillon Cup is the perfect accessory to have in your kitchen. Order yours today and experience the convenience, durability, and style that it offers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WJZgBbRaL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carlisle FoodService Products","source_asin":"B0BZ2V9RLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ2V9RLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ2V9RLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
