window.products.push({"id":896827,"name":"Tea Kettle Stovetop - Harriet 3 Liter Teapot Whistling Kettle with 3-Layered Durable Bases - Food Grade Stainless Steel Kettles with Hot-Resistant Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b8k+4nEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[UPGRADE 3-LAYER DURABLE BOTTOM]: The bottom of the teapot is upgrade three-layer bottom design; The innermost layer is food-grade 304 stainless steel, which has anti-rust effect; The middle layer of aluminum has fast heat transfer and heating speed; And the outermost layer of 430 stainless steel with more magnetic conductivity, it is heating faster and evenly heated when be used on an induction cooker; It is more rust-proof and water-leak-proof than ordinary single-layer bottoms. [FOOD GRADE MATERIAL]: Harriet stovetop kettle uses food-grade stainless steel materials and has FDA professional certification; The stainless steel electrolysis process is used in the interior of kettle to ensure that the teapot is rust-resistant and corrosion-resistant. This teapot can provide better health protection for your family. [ERGONOMIC HANDLE]: This kettle adopts heat-resistant resin handle, anti-hot effectly, with an additional heat insulation mat to protect your table. And the tea kettle with new diamond look design can brighten up your kitchen! The use-friendly button allows you to easily open or close the spout without worrying about getting burned by steam. [LOUD & AUTOMATIC WHISTLING]: When you focus on housework, movies, music or anything else, the loud whistle can quickly attract your attention and remind you to turn off the fire in time. (Tip: Just fill up 80% of the capacity to ensure the whistling tea kettle can work when water is boiling.) [Apply to Various Stovetops & WORRY-FREE PURCHASE]: Applicable for induction cooker, electric furnace, gas and natural gas stovetop (Please use small or medium fire on gas stove). All our products have a full 12-month warranty. If you have any questions about Harriet kettle, please feel free to contact us and we will help you fix your issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b8k+4nEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"harriet","source_asin":"B0943RML7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0943RML7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0943RML7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
