window.products.push({"id":896969,"name":"Lovendo | Handmade | Solid Wood Table Top | Butcher Block Counter Top | 45‘‘ x 23.6 ‘‘ inch | Thickness 1.18'' | Matte Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Fw4y2UiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED SOLID NATURAL WOOD HAS CHARACTER. Thanks to the natural variations in the grain of all lumber, each piece of solid wood furniture is unique. This gives it more character than other types of furniture- synthetic materials like melamine or laminate that are churned out looking identical. IT’S A SMART INVESTMENT.  Less durable furniture needs to be replaced far more frequently. But those solid wood pieces in your home can last a lifetime, so they can be a one-time purchase. IT’S EXCEPTIONALLY VERSATILE. Regardless whether a room’s décor is vintage, mid-century modern, minimalist, industrial, rustic, coastal, traditional, transitional, a quirky blend, or something else entirely, wood furniture can fit right in. IT CAN BE TRANSFORMED, TOO. Sanding, staining, and refinishing provide convenient opportunities to change the look of your solid wood furniture at some point down the line. IT’S NATURAL.Coming right from the heart of nature, the solid wood used in furniture makes it environment-friendly. There are no chemicals used in it, thus making it safe for all the people allergic toward chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Fw4y2UiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovendo","source_asin":"B0953BTK11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-896969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0953BTK11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0953BTK11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
